# Generated fuzzing state is NEVER committed. libFuzzer writes thousands of
# generated inputs into corpus/ and crash artifacts into artifacts/, both of
# which churn on every run.
artifacts/
target/
corpus/

# The COMMITTED regression corpus lives in regressions/, NOT in corpus/, and is
# deliberately outside this ignore. See fuzz/README.md for why the two are
# separate directories rather than one directory with exceptions.
